---
const year = new Date().getFullYear();
---
<footer>
  <div class="container footer-inner">
    <p><strong>KorClassIC</strong> · 한국 고전을 더 쉽게 읽을 수 있도록.</p>
    <p class="muted">© {year} KorClassIC · Code is open source. Content licenses are tracked per work.</p>
  </div>
</footer>
<style>
  footer { padding: 56px 0 34px; }
  .footer-inner { border-top: 1px solid var(--line); padding-top: 22px; display: flex; justify-content: space-between; gap: 20px; font-size: .82rem; }
  .footer-inner p { margin: 0; }
  @media (max-width: 700px) { .footer-inner { flex-direction: column; } }
</style>
